 * PLP's own hover reveal via Figma node `40002187:58460` (see index.tsx's module docblock); the
 * SFCC-236 Jira AC text alone does not mention this reveal for Wishlist, so this is worth an
 * explicit second look by whoever eyeballs this story.
 */
